@startuml
title Inventory Management System - Components (AS IS)
[Console UI] as UI
[MyInventorySystem] as App
[InventoryManager] as Manager
[File Storage] as Storage

UI --> App: user interaction
App --> Manager: calls (Add/Update/Delete/View/Save/Load)
Manager --> Storage: SaveToFile/LoadFromFile

note left of UI
  Console-based UI implemented in MyInventorySystem
end note

note right of Storage
  Simple file-based persistence (SaveToFile / LoadFromFile)
end note

@enduml
